1	en	148	0x944b0	37963	20				v_bri_kaz0010_000_0	22	We can get some more people together and build\nthis place up into a proper home for MSF.\n
1	en	148	0x944b0	37963	21				v_bri_kaz0010_000_0	22	You're with me on this, right, Boss?\n
