1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	0				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	You know that today, Japan is under the American\nnuclear umbrella...\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	1				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	Right.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	2				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	The U.S. vowed to retaliate against any country\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	3				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	that launches a nuclear strike against an allied\ncountry...\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	4				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	That promise deters nuclear attacks against\nAmerica's allies.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	5				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	Hence the term "nuclear umbrella."\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	6				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	But suppose the Russians nuked Tokyo.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	7				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	Would America really nuke Moscow in return?\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	8				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	If they did, the Soviet Union would undoubtedly\nretaliate.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	9				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	Would Washington really be willing to risk\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	10				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	having a bomb dropped on itself in order to\navenge Japan?\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	11				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	...I'm not so sure.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	12				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	Don't tell me you're still worried about Japan. After\nall these years?\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	13				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	It's not that. I just...\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	14				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	To be honest, I'm not convinced, either.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	15				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	But Moscow faces the same dilemma. Maybe\nWashington wouldn't retaliate on Japan's behalf.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	16				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	Then again, maybe it would.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	17				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	So you're saying Moscow wouldn't want to risk\nbeing attacked, either...\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	18				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	The whole concept of nuclear deterrence is\nentirely hypothetical to begin with.\n
1	en	159	0x9f870	40839	19				v_bri_kaz0310_010_0	20	When you get down to it, it's all smoke and mirrors.\n
1	en	159	0x9ff20	40946	0					1	"Japan shall not possess, manufacture, or allow the\nintroduction of nuclear weapons into Japan"...\n
