1	en	164	0xa47a0	42106	3	2382	3218	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0010_000_0	9	We're outnumbered and in unfamiliar territory.\n
1	en	164	0xa47a0	42106	4	3232	4416	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0010_000_0	9	We won't survive long in a straight fight, even with\nyou on our side.\n
