1	en	164	0xa47a0	42106	8	8010	8693	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0010_000_0	9	It's the essence of guerrilla warfare.\n
1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	0	459	919	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	Can I ask you a favor, Snake?\n
1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	1	919	1657	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	If you ask nicely.\n
1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	2	1657	2605	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	To make MSF bigger, we need to do some\nrecruiting.\n
