1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	4	3371	5224	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	I want you to avoid killing enemy soldiers as much\nas possible and send them back using Fulton\nrecovery.\n
1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	5	5224	6032	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	Not much we can do with a corpse except give it a\nfuneral.\n
