1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	7	6366	7272	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	Put 'em to sleep, knock 'em out...hold 'em up, even.\n
1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	8	7272	8526	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	And if you do have to fight, try to leave them near\ndeath instead of dead.\n
1	en	164	0xa4b00	42160	9	8540	9849	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_kaz0650_000_0	11	And then use the Fulton recovery system...sounds\neasy enough.\n
