1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	Don't carry any more gear than you need.\n
1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	If you try and stuff your entire arsenal into your\nbackpack,\n
1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	it'll be too heavy and your mobility will be impaired.\n
1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	You'll only be hurting yourself.\n
1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	I know. Take only what you need. Every rookie\nknows that.\n
1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	5				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	You can check the weight of your gear before\nheading out.\n
1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	6				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	So make sure you do.\n
1	en	165	0xa5290	42281	7				v_bri_mis_kaz0030_000_0	8	Got it.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	0	445	1476	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	Even a born warrior like you gets hand tremors,\nSnake.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	1	1518	2229	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	It happens even when you're full of stamina,\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	2	2229	3747	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	and it only gets worse when you're tired -\nespecially with larger, heavier weapons.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	3	3775	4890	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	Obviously, you'll get better aim crouching than you\nwill standing.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	4	4904	5976	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	And when you use a scope, setting your sights on\na single point\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	5	5976	6840	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	will gradually give you a more precise aim.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	6	6924	7732	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	As we develop better weapons at Mother Base,\nthough,\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	7	7732	8986	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	you may gain access to new, low-tremor versions\nof the same guns.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	8	9000	9710	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	So if you expect the shakes to be a problem,\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	9	9752	10574	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	you might want to put some resources into R&D.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	10	10574	11744	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	I'll keep it in mind. Then again, the more you use a\nweapon,\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	11	11744	12301	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	the more your hands get used to it.\n
1	en	165	0xa5540	42324	12	12301	13193	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_kaz0050_000_0	13	Sometimes it pays to be faithful to your gun.\n
1	en	165	0xa5a00	42400	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_000_0	2	Choosing the right uniform is crucial.\n
1	en	165	0xa5a00	42400	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_000_0	2	Pick one that matches the mission objective and\nyour own combat style.\n
1	en	165	0xa5b10	42417	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_010_0	6	Jungle fatigues are made for jungle combat.\n
1	en	165	0xa5b10	42417	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_010_0	6	They provide decent protection and let you carry\na fair number of weapons. Your standard uniform,\nbasically.\n
1	en	165	0xa5b10	42417	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_010_0	6	The distinguishing factor is that your camo index\nwill vary - a lot - depending on the area.\n
1	en	165	0xa5b10	42417	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_010_0	6	Wear a pattern that makes you blend in with your\nsurroundings and your camo index goes up.\n
1	en	165	0xa5b10	42417	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_010_0	6	Wear something that clashes and you'll stick out\nlike a sore thumb.\n
1	en	165	0xa5b10	42417	5				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_010_0	6	Pick the right pattern for the occasion - Sigint\nused to lecture me on it all the time.\n
1	en	165	0xa5e20	42466	0					7	The sneaking suit is a specialized uniform for\nstealth missions.\n
1	en	165	0xa5e20	42466	1					7	It provides excellent camo in any stage.\n
1	en	165	0xa5e20	42466	2					7	Even better, you won't make a sound when you\nwalk.\n
1	en	165	0xa5e20	42466	3					7	So I won't need to tiptoe all the time.\n
1	en	165	0xa5e20	42466	4					7	And, to top it off, it also makes your wounds heal\nfaster.\n
1	en	165	0xa5e20	42466	5					7	The fabric exerts just the right amount of\npressure on your body to help stop bleeding.\n
1	en	165	0xa5e20	42466	6					7	Not a bad little trick.\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	The battle dress uniform is the opposite of the\nsneaking suit\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	in that it's specialized for combat.\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	It lets you carry plenty of weapons and ammo, and\nprovides excellent protection.\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	Not the best choice for sneaking, but if you feel\nlike playing one-man army,\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	this is the uniform of choice.\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	5				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	Looks pretty damn heavy.\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	6				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	It is. You won't be able to move as fast with it on,\n
1	en	166	0xa60d0	42509	7				v_bri_mis_kaz0040_030_0	8	meaning it's not good for running away, either.\nKeep that in mind.\n
1	en	166	0xa63e0	42558	0	459	1462	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0040_040_0	15	Naked... That's exactly what you are with this\nuniform.\n
1	en	166	0xa63e0	42558	1	1476	2187	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0040_040_0	15	The pants are the same as the jungle fatigues.\n
