1	en	166	0xa63e0	42558	3	3009	3859	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0040_040_0	15	your defense and camo index are going to be low.\n
1	en	166	0xa63e0	42558	4	3928	5001	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0040_040_0	15	On the plus side, it's so light you can move around\nquicker.\n
