1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	Stand still when you're Snake In and you and your\nteammates will start to get in sync.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	In sync?\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	That's right. Stay still together and you'll enter\nSnake Sync mode.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	The synergy will give you a boost in performance.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	You'll move faster, recover faster, and have better\ncamouflage.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	5				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	In other words, we're at our best when we're in the\nsame groove.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	6				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	You got it. If you've got a big task ahead,\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	7				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	it can't hurt to take some time to get in sync.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	8				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	Like I said before, the benefits you get from Snake\nSync\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	9				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	depend on your camaraderie.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	10				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	I hear ya.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	11				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	It's a lot easier knowing you've got someone you\nknow and trust covering your back.\n
1	en	168	0xa84e0	43086	12				v_bri_mis_kaz0100_010_1	13	It lets you focus that much more on what you have\nto do.\n
1	en	168	0xa8980	43160	0	445	1407	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0110_000_0	16	If camaraderie represents how much your\nteammates trust you,\n
