1	en	173	0xadb70	44471	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0220_000_0	6	Good for whatever weapon you want to practice\nwith.\n
1	en	173	0xadb70	44471	5				v_bri_mis_kaz0220_000_0	6	Aim quick, and aim true.\n
