1	en	174	0xae030	44547	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0260_000_0	5	As you're probably aware, this is a Fulton recovery\nmission.\n
1	en	174	0xae030	44547	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0260_000_0	5	Be careful you don't shoot and kill any prisoners by\naccident.\n
1	en	174	0xae030	44547	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0260_000_0	5	And don't forget to take the recovery kit with you.\n
1	en	174	0xae030	44547	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0260_000_0	5	I'd suggest arming yourself with a tranquilizer gun\njust to be safe\n
1	en	174	0xae030	44547	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0260_000_0	5	- so you don't kill any prisoners.\n
1	en	174	0xae250	44581	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0280_000_0	6	This is a sweep-and-destroy mission, not a\nsneaking mission.\n
1	en	174	0xae250	44581	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0280_000_0	6	Don't think you're going to slip through this one\nunnoticed. You will fight.\n
