1	en	174	0xae250	44581	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0280_000_0	6	What's more important is choosing gear that offers\nphysical protection.\n
1	en	174	0xae250	44581	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0280_000_0	6	And of course you'll need a big enough arsenal to\ntake care of business.\n
1	en	174	0xae250	44581	5				v_bri_mis_kaz0280_000_0	6	Oh, and don't forget your recovery items, either!\n
1	en	174	0xae4e0	44622	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0290_000_0	7	To hold up an enemy, you need to get behind them\nwithout being seen.\n
