1	en	174	0xae7b0	44667	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0310_000_0	5	like a gasoline drum or an unmanned weapon with\na full fuel tank...\n
1	en	174	0xae7b0	44667	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0310_000_0	5	Then shoot it and blow it up. And make sure it\ntakes a few enemies with it!\n
