1	en	175	0xaf200	44832	13	13360	14433	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0350_000_0	19	When I was a kid, my neighbors had a pet pig they\ncalled Pooyan.\n
1	en	175	0xaf200	44832	14	14447	15617	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0350_000_0	19	Every time I see a Fulton balloon, it reminds me of\nthat litle porker.\n
