1	en	176	0xb00d0	45069	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0460_000_0	4	You'll be using C4 for demolition.\n
1	en	176	0xb00d0	45069	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0460_000_0	4	As you might imagine, it's gonna make a big noise\nwhen it detonates.\n
1	en	176	0xb00d0	45069	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0460_000_0	4	For your own safety, make sure you put plenty of\ndistance\n
1	en	176	0xb00d0	45069	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0460_000_0	4	between yourself and the C4 before detonating it.\n
1	en	176	0xb0290	45097	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0480_000_0	1	Boss, we're not sure where your gear is being\nstored.\n
1	en	176	0xb0350	45109	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0510_000_0	4	Amanda and her crew tell me they've managed to\nidentify several different categories\n
1	en	176	0xb0350	45109	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0510_000_0	4	of mercenaries employed by the CIA.\n
1	en	176	0xb0350	45109	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0510_000_0	4	Give me a rundown. Sounds like info I could use.\n
1	en	176	0xb0350	45109	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0510_000_0	4	No problem. I'll go through them in order.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	0	445	1058	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	The type of enemy you'll be seeing most\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	1	1058	2368	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	is the type that patrols and guards a specific\noperational area.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	2	2396	3775	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	For the sake of convenience, Amanda's crew calls\nthe outdoor ones "patrolmen,"\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	3	3775	4374	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	and the indoor ones "guards."\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	4	4388	5043	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	They might look like they're just out for a stroll,\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	5	5043	5907	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	but don't be fooled - they're sharper than they\nlook.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	6	5948	6757	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	All of their senses are finely honed.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	7	6812	7592	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	Normally they'll patrol along fixed routes,\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	8	7592	8818	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	but when the alert level is raised they'll assume a\nmore efficient alert posture\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	9	8818	10156	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	and focus on defending specific points. That's bad\nfor you.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	10	10253	10978	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	Obviously they can hold their own in combat,\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	11	10978	12051	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	and with body armor it'll be even harder to take\nthem down.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	12	12106	12692	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	If they're wearing a bulletproof helmet,\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	13	12705	13876	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	you can forget about one-shot kills. Just a heads\nup.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	14	13945	15116	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	You'll need to be smart about using camo and pick\nyour routes.\n
1	en	176	0xb0510	45137	15	15144	16063	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0520_000_0	16	The most important thing is to avoid detection.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	0	445	1852	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	When the enemy spots you and goes on alert, they\nmay call in a backup strike team.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	1	1866	3120	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	These assault teams are heavily armed, well\ntrained, and highly dangerous.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	2	3134	3873	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	Amanda's crew calls them "commandos."\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	3	3900	5670	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	Unlike the patrolmen, these guys will actively,\nrelentlessly track and hunt you down - like hounds.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	4	6032	7216	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	Hounds to hunt a former FOXHOUND... Bring it on.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	5	7244	8080	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	They won't give up easily even if they lose sight of\nyou.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	6	8080	9083	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	They'll clear out any likely hiding places they come\nacross.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	7	9097	10267	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	So don't get too comfy in one spot or you might\nget caught again.\n
1	en	176	0xb0af0	45231	8	10281	11173	0x0e463a34	v_bri_mis_kaz0530_000_0	13	Keep your eyes fixed on them and what they're\ndoing.\n
