1	en	177	0xb1000	45312	0				v_bri_mis_kaz0540_000_0	6	There's one type of commando you really need to\nwatch out for,\n
1	en	177	0xb1000	45312	1				v_bri_mis_kaz0540_000_0	6	and that's the kind toting shotguns.\n
1	en	177	0xb1000	45312	2				v_bri_mis_kaz0540_000_0	6	They can take a few hits and still keep charging\nyou.\n
