1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	3				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Not much difference between them and any other\nscout in terms of combat ability,\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	4				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	but it does make them harder to spot.\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	5				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	I'm sure it does.\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	6				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	You've come across these before?\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	7				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Yeah. The Soviet Union...\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	8				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	The first time, it took me a full hour to find the\nguy and take him out...\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	9				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Kaz, do you know if they shine?\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	10				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	...Shine. Like how?\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	11				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Like from their heads.\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	12				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Their heads?\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	13				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	How about their hair? Do they have a lot of it?\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	14				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	What are you talking about? How the hell would I\nknow?\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	15				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	How about a parrot? Did anybody hear a parrot\nsquawk?\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	16				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	A parrot? Look, Snake, you're talking to the wrong\nguy.\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	17				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	I mean, Cecile's the bird expert...\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	18				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Wait a second, what am I saying? You're not\nmaking any sense to begin with!\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	19				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Never mind. It's... a long story. I'll figure out another\nway. Forget about it.\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	20				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Yeah, I'll do that.\n
1	en	177	0xb1640	45412	21				v_bri_mis_kaz0560_000_0	23	Anyway, we've already lost too many good people\nto these surprise encounters.\n
