1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	0	473	1226	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	Costa Rica means "rich coast" in Spanish.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	1	1267	2089	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	Is it true that Columbus was the one who came up\nwith the name?\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	2	2173	3092	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	Your guess is as good as mine. But it is true\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	3	3092	4388	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	that Columbus landed his ships near Limón back in\nthe Age of Exploration.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	4	4458	5154	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	He wrote in his diary that when he landed,\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	5	5224	6352	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	the indígena showered him with gifts of gold.\nHence the name.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	6	6394	6938	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	It sounds a little strange to me.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	7	7007	7955	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	There is no way they could find that much gold in\nCosta Rica.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	8	7983	9153	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	Columbus originally set sail in search of the\nlegendary land of gold.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	9	9320	9961	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	Maybe he was just nuts about the stuff.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	10	9975	10644	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	Costa Rica is rich enough without it.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	11	10727	11800	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	Look at the forests and the animals, and the\npeace-loving people...\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	12	11814	12329	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	That is what I want to protect.\n
1	en	179	0xb3710	45937	13	12357	12914	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_paz0010_000_0	14	...I know how you feel.\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	0	473	1825	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	Democracy took root in Costa Rica before\nanywhere else in Central America.\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	1	1894	3162	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	Sure, we had coups and dictators and all, but\nnever a total meltdown.\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	2	3287	4026	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	That is, until 26 years ago...\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	3	4082	5726	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	The civil war. Yeah, I understand you lost your\ngrandparents.\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	4	5753	6868	0x0e55d959	v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	It started with a dispute over alleged fraud in the\npresidential election.\n
