1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	7	8832	9613	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	Yeah, that... would have been nice.\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	8				v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	Even today, some buildings still have bullet holes\nfrom the civil war.\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	9				v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	A quarter century later, and it is a tragedy we\nticos cannot forget... Must not forget.\n
1	en	179	0xb3be0	46014	10				v_bri_paz0020_000_0	11	It was the year after the civil war that the army\nwas constitutionally abolished.\n
1	en	180	0xb4050	46085	0				v_bri_paz0030_000_0	8	A new president was elected this year - President\nOduber.\n
1	en	180	0xb4050	46085	1				v_bri_paz0030_000_0	8	He seems to be distancing himself from the United\nStates.\n
