1	en	180	0xb4050	46085	3				v_bri_paz0030_000_0	8	Our last president was so pro-U.S., people\nsuspected he was in bed with the CIA.\n
1	en	180	0xb4050	46085	4				v_bri_paz0030_000_0	8	You think the CIA's doing this because it feels\nthreatened by the president's shift in policy...?\n
1	en	180	0xb4050	46085	5				v_bri_paz0030_000_0	8	It is possible. But would they really bring in such a\nhuge army just because of that?\n
