1	en	180	0xb4050	46085	7				v_bri_paz0030_000_0	8	Exactly. Thanks, Snake. Peace.\n
1	en	180	0xb43c0	46140	0	487	1755	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_paz0050_000_0	13	So are you a student at the University for Peace,\nPaz?\n
