1	en	181	0xb5b70	46519	10					18	But America supported us all the same. It was\nbecause we practiced peaceful diplomacy...\n
1	en	181	0xb5b70	46519	11					18	That is what I like to think.\n
1	en	181	0xb5b70	46519	12					18	That's one way to approach it, sure.\n
1	en	181	0xb5b70	46519	13					18	But there are countries out there who'll use force\nno matter how bad it looks.\n
