1	en	181	0xb5b70	46519	15					18	But it's not like we expect peace without working\nfor it.\n
1	en	181	0xb5b70	46519	16					18	Diplomacy is a battle in itself.\n
1	en	181	0xb5b70	46519	17					18	And we have to make the effort\n
