1	en	189	0xbdbd0	48573	12					15	If they need extra power during the day,\n
1	en	189	0xbdbd0	48573	13					15	they can generate it using water pumped up during\nthe night.\n
1	en	189	0xbdbd0	48573	14					15	I get it. It's a little more difficult to adjust output\nwith thermal or nuclear plants.\n
