1	en	204	0xcc320	52274	3	3524	4360	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0	11	Trying to force your way through would be suicide.\n
1	en	204	0xcc320	52274	4	4388	5377	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0	11	Know the enemy's location before making any\nmoves.\n
1	en	204	0xcc320	52274	5	5405	6004	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0	11	Too bad you don't have some sort of radar.\n
