1	en	204	0xcc320	52274	7	6729	7843	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0	11	Once you know where an enemy is, decide how you\nwant to handle him.\n
1	en	204	0xcc320	52274	8	7871	8373	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0	11	You could get into his blindspots...\n
1	en	204	0xcc320	52274	9	8414	9626	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0	11	Or drop him from a distance before he even has a\nclue someone's around.\n
1	en	204	0xcc320	52274	10	9640	10267	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0	11	An eye for an eye, right?\n
