1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	1	1351	2145	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	Guerilla tactics would work well in a place like that.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	2	2159	3357	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	Moving from tree to tree will make it hard to get a\nfix on you from the air.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	3	3385	3747	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	That's your best chance.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	4	3761	4862	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	Good thinking, comandante. You clearly know your\nway around a battlefield.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	5	4876	6060	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	Enough, Boss. Time to stop talking and start using\nyour ears.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	6	6074	7035	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	When you're hiding, you won't be able to see the\nchopper that well.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	7	7063	8052	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	It's important to use sound to get a read on its\nposition.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	8	8066	9543	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	You could also try taking out its tail rotor. That\nwould greatly reduce its mobility.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	9	9571	10044	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	And watch out for ground troops.\n
1	en	204	0xcc700	52336	10	10058	10630	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0	11	Copy that, comandante.\n
1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	0	445	1226	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	The paths there are buried in vegetation.\n
1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	1	1239	2410	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	Work with nature to conceal yourself, and you'll be\nmuch harder to spot.\n
1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	2	2563	3204	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	A ghillie suit would be perfect here.\n
1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	3	3232	4667	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	In any case, take caution when advancing. Don't\nwear anything that stands out.\n
1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	4	4681	5642	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	The ruins are a labyrinth, so try and keep your\nbearings.\n
