1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	9	9376	10825	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	It's not necessarily a good idea to try to engage a\nsniper in close-quarters combat.\n
1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	10	10853	12134	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	Finally, once you've found a place to hide don't let\nthem take you from behind.\n
1	en	204	0xccb20	52402	11	12176	13277	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_amd0100_000_0	12	Don't worry. No one sneaks up on me.\n
