1	en	205	0xcd210	52513	1	1532	2326	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0120_000_0	11	Looks like you have a lot of places to hide there.\n
1	en	205	0xcd210	52513	2	2354	3650	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0120_000_0	11	Remember your fight with the other chopper.\nGuerilla tactics will be key.\n
