1	en	205	0xcd210	52513	9	9613	10240	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_mis_amd0120_000_0	11	I'd rather not have to take that chance.\n
1	en	205	0xcd210	52513	10	10267	10992	0x0e3bb338	v_bri_mis_amd0120_000_0	11	Indeed, that would be best.\n
