1	en	205	0xcdce0	52686	9				v_bri_mis_amd0130_000_0	10	No, you've given me some ideas.\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	0				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	Wow, you made it all the way to el basilisco's\nhangar.\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	1				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	None of us has ever gone that far. I have no idea\nwhat the underground base is like.\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	2				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	Wish I could say the same.\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	3				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	It'll most likely be some kind of building, so...\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	4				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	...Plenty of places to hide.\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	5				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	Right, but security will be extremely tight.\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	6				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	Do not forget that the odds are stacked heavily\nagainst you.\n
1	en	206	0xce040	52740	7				v_bri_mis_amd0160_000_0	8	Yeah.\n
