1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	0				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	Apparently, UFOs are connected to cattle\nmutilations.\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	1				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	Cattle mutations?\n
