1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	3				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	People have been reporting their livestock dying\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	4				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	in mysterious ways near the same places where\nUFOs have been sighted.\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	5				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	They say\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	6				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	the bodies are drained of blood and the eyeballs\nand sexual organs are gouged out.\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	7				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	When you leave a corpse cut open in a field\nsomewhere, the ground soaks up the blood.\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	8				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	Yeah, but supposedly these cows weren't cut up\nby any man-made means.\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	9				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	Maybe maggots got to 'em?\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	10				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	In some cases they detected radiation.\n
