1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	12				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	Even in our own town we had goats that died in\nstrange ways.\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	13				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	Some said they saw a monster\n
1	en	212	0xd4880	54408	14				v_bri_chc0100_010_0	20	- a lizard on two legs, covered in spines from its\nhead all the way down its back.\n
