1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	0				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Chico. I, uh... I met that talking cat.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	1				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	The legendary Trenya? Really?!\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	2				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Trenya? Yeah, that's what it called itself. Is it\nfamous?\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	3				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	In certain circles, yeah.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	4				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	I'm still having trouble believing it.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	5				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	I never thought I'd be talking to an animal one day.\nWhat a world.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	6				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Amazing you could understand its language.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	7				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Picking up the local lingo is one of the basics of\nintelligence work.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	8				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	That's what makes you the Boss, Boss! Hey, say\nsomething in Trenya's language, will you?\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	9				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Meow? Meow... Meow meow meow...\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	10				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Wow! I have no idea what you're saying!\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	11				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	...Of course you wouldn't.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	12				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	So what did Trenya say?\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	13				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	It said it would take me to that island you talked\nabout.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	14				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Really?! Take me too, Boss! Please, please!\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	15				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	I know you must be excited, but we don't know\nwhat's out there.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	16				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	It could be dangerous. I'll scout it out first.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	17				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	No fair!\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	18				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	Come on, Chico. This isn't as cut and dry as you\nthink.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	19				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	You can come next time, depending on what I find.\n
1	en	214	0xd63b0	54843	20				v_bri_mis_chc0010_010_0	21	I'll take some photos if I get the chance. Sorry,\nkid, but that's life.\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	0				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	Apparently there are other cats that talk besides\nTrenya on Isla del Monstruo.\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	1				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	There's more of them?\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	2				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	Yep. They're called the Felynes, but supposedly\nthey don't ever come to Costa Rica.\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	3				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	You should try talking to them if you spot them.\nWho knows what kinda stuff they have to say.\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	4				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	Yeah. Just when you think things can't get any\ncrazier...\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	5				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	Also, the Felynes are nice to humans, so you be\nsure and be nice back.\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	6				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	Don't you go attacking them or anything.\n
1	en	214	0xd6a70	54951	7				v_bri_chc0140_010_0	8	I would never hurt a defenseless little kitty.\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	0					8	I used to have this book full of pirate lore.\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	1					8	It had this story about Rathalos, King of the Skies.\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	2					8	Most accounts describe it as a dragon with wings,\nor a wyvern.\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	3					8	A wyvern... A two-legged dragon. Vlad the Impaler's\ncoat of arms had one on it.\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	4					8	Yeah, and he was the model for Count Dracula.\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	5					8	There are reports of ships being attacked out in\nthe middle of the ocean,\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	6					8	so Rathalos must be able to fly great distances.\n
1	en	214	0xd6dc0	55004	7					8	And what's more, Rathalos is said to breathe fire!\n
