1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	0				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	Tigrex is a wyvern just like Rathalos.\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	1				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	But it's good at moving around on land, too.\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	2				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	It can blast you with rocks from a distance, or\nrush at you with incredible speed.\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	3				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	People have seen it on land?\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	4				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	Sí.\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	5				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	It's said that these two lady pirates, Anne and\nMary, visited Isla del Monstruo.\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	6				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	It was there that they did battle with Tigrex.\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	7				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	Anne was quite a marksman, wasn't she?\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	8				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	Must've been a heck of a battle. I wish I'd been\nthere.\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	9				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	You know, I'm not so bad with guns myself...\n
1	en	215	0xd71b0	55067	10				v_bri_mis_chc0010_030_0	11	I've already seen how good you are.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	0				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	Anne and Mary also saw little dinosaurs running\naround the island.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	1				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	Velocipreys?\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	2				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	Yup. As you'd expect they're very nimble - but no\nmatch for a firearm.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	3				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	You wouldn't want to get surrounded by them,\nthough.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	4				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	I'll bet. Nobody wants to be outnumbered in battle.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	5				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	Right. Your best move would be to make sure they\ncannot encircle you.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	6				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	Well, stealth is the basis of all solo sneaking\nmissions...\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	7				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	While it makes battle tougher,\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	8				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	working alone has its advantages when it comes to\ninfiltration.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	9				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	That's what makes you the boss, Boss! You don't\nneed any advice from me.\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	10				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	Not bad for an old-timer, eh Chico?\n
1	en	215	0xd7560	55126	11				v_bri_mis_chc0010_040_0	12	Nope. Still, be careful.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	0				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Have you heard the legend about the dinosaur that\ncame back to life as a zombie\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	1				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	and attacked people?\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	2				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Zombie?! You mean the living dead?\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	3				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Yeah. Dinosaurs may be extinct,\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	4				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	but technically it would be possible for one to\ncome back to life as a zombie.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	5				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Not so fast. Dinosaurs were real, zombies... not so\nmuch.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	6				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	What are you talking about, Boss!\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	7				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Zombies have been used as slaves on Haitian\nplantations for years.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	8				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	In Haiti they've handed down a secret zombie\npowder for generations.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	9				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	...Really?\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	10				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	People from long ago must have used that same\nstuff on dinosaur remains.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	11				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	But dinosaurs had been extinct for millions of\nyears before the first humans-\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	12				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	That hypothesis has to be wrong.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	13				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	...In any case, this zombie was incredibly powerful.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	14				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Its name was Gear REX. They say nothing could kill\nit.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	15				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Some say its bodily fluids would burn right through\nyour flesh.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	16				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Then the spines that fell off its back would impale\nyou,\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	17				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	the pain made even worse by the deafening roar\nrattling every bone in your body.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	18				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	...You sure it wasn't just some really strong\nmonster?\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	19				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Who knows what kind of dinosaurs were out there.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	20				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	We could be talking about something strong\nenough to resist small arms fire.\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	21				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	Are you afraid of zombies, Boss?\n
1	en	215	0xd79a0	55194	22				v_bri_mis_chc0010_050_0	23	...No. I just find the whole thing hard to believe.\n
1	en	216	0xd81a0	55322	0				v_bri_mis_chc0020_000_0	11	A fantasma is an espiritu that wanders this plane\ninstead of going to el Cielo.\n
1	en	216	0xd81a0	55322	1				v_bri_mis_chc0020_000_0	11	There are different interpretations, of course, but\nthat's what I think.\n
