1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	0	473	1462	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	The opposite direction... What does that mean?\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	1	1490	3092	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	More and more AI are becoming systems that\nspecialize in mass information processing\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	2	3176	4304	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	- without human intelligence, thought, or emotion.\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	3	4388	5349	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	A machine that has no individualism or sense of\nself,\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	4	5461	7077	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	but rather behaves as a collective, exhibiting the\nqualities of a society.\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	5	7091	7453	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	Like a beehive?\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	6	7509	9557	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	Yes. It aggregates data collected by individuals and\ndetermines how the collective will act\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	7	9613	10685	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	just as honeybees travel between the hive and\nflowers.\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	8	10769	11939	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	The key to achieving that will be networking AI\ntogether.\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	9	11995	13193	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	I don't know how to say this, but... that kind of\ngives me the creeps.\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	10	13221	14586	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	But if your goal is to control society, it's the better\nmodel to use.\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	11	14642	16133	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	It lets you filter data - disseminate only what you\nwant disseminated.\n
1	en	223	0xdf350	57141	12	16202	17707	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0060_010_0	13	Of course, I myself have no interest in an AI\nwithout a shred of life to it.\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	0	473	2452	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	Earlier, you called the Mammal Pod a butterfly. Not\na pupa or a cocoon, but an imago.\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	1	2507	3873	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	Yes. The AI that came before the Mammal Pod\nwere works in progress.\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	2	3928	4332	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	Works in progress?\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	3	4346	4931	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	They were enough to keep the frame running.\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	4	4931	6018	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	But not enough to make decisions about nuclear\nretaliation.\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	5	6060	6965	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	They weren't quite complete. They were pupae.\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	6	7035	8359	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	Only when I added The Boss' data did the AI take\non its true form,\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	7	8512	9376	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	becoming a butterfly and taking flight.\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	8	9404	10448	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	And that's why the nose art on Peace Walker was\na butterfly...\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	9	10476	11730	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	I gave the Mammal AI the code name "BS-Imago."\n
1	en	223	0xdf880	57224	10	11828	12705	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0070_000_0	11	"BS" is short for Boss.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	0					15	Huey called that gigantic unmanned chopper a\nChrysalis.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	1					15	Is that another one of your AI code names?\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	2					15	Yes. You're referring to the TJ-Chrysalis 6000.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	3					15	There's also the GW-Pupa 5000, the TR-Cocoon\n7000...\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	4					15	I get it. A hovercraft type and a treaded type....\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	5					15	And those letters on the front, TJ and GW or\nwhatever, those are initials?\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	6					15	Correct. The initials of the American Presidents\nwhose faces are carved\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	7					15	into Mount Rushmore.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	8					15	Then you're missing one.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	9					15	I assigned that one to the Reptile Pod. AL-Aurelia\n8000.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	10					15	Aurelia... another word for chrysalis... a pupa just\nbefore it emerges.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	11					15	All of the initials except for "BS" were of Coldman's\nchoosing.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	12					15	I chose mine from the storied ranks of British\nroyalty.\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	13					15	MS, AV, EW...\n
1	en	223	0xdfc70	57287	14					15	...What do those stand for.\n
