1	en	227	0xe3280	58152	0	487	1407	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_dsl0160_000_1	20	So you were with ARPA before you came here,\nhuh?\n
1	en	227	0xe3280	58152	1	1476	3037	0x0ebd8542	v_bri_dsl0160_000_1	20	Yes. Back then it was really the only place I could\nmake a living from my AI research.\n
