1	en	227	0xe3aa0	58282	1				v_bri_dsl0170_000_0	20	You intrigued me.\n
1	en	227	0xe3aa0	58282	2				v_bri_dsl0170_000_0	20	Me? ...Hold on, you're not planning on modeling\nyour next AI after me...\n
1	en	227	0xe3aa0	58282	3				v_bri_dsl0170_000_0	20	Not a bad idea. But I have no intention of ever\nagain attempting to transplant\n
