1	en	227	0xe3aa0	58282	5				v_bri_dsl0170_000_0	20	...That's a relief.\n
1	en	227	0xe3aa0	58282	6				v_bri_dsl0170_000_0	20	You are the man who inherited The Boss's will.\n
