1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	0				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	That was some escape you made from\nStrangelove's lab.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	1				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Security inside was not so tight.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	2				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	The door to my room was locked from the outside,\nof course.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	3				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	But she took off the blindfold at bath time - so she\ncould wash my hair...\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	4				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Pretty luxurious treatment for a prisoner.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	5				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Wasn't it? She wouldn't undo the handcuffs, but\nshe washed my body for me instead.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	6				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	And with such gentle care...\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	7				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Why'd you run away? Didn't she say you could go\nhome in a month?\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	8				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	If your escape attempt failed, you'd be in greater\ndanger than before.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	9				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	I was supposed to be giving a presentation\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	10				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	on the distribution of Costa Rican bird species at a\nconference.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	11				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	The date was approaching quickly.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	12				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	So I pretended I had to use the toilet and made\nmy escape.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	13				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	I found an ID card and searched everywhere for\nmy equipment and my tape...\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	14				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	But a soldier saw me. It was a miracle I managed\nto get away.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	15				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	There was no time to find the tape.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	16				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	I don't care about the conference. I'm lucky\nenough to still be in one piece.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	17				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	You bounce back quick.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	18				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	You don't?\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	19				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	....Not sure. I try not to dwell too much on the past,\nbut...\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	20				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Then don't. There's no point. I'm so glad to be out\nof there.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	21				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	I never felt safe, you know?\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	22				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Tell me about it.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	23				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Well... I think she's interested in women. And I think\nshe took a fancy to me.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	24				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	That's, uh.... huh.\n
1	en	230	0xe6480	58952	25				v_bri_ccl0010_000_0	26	Besides, it's much nicer here.\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	0					14	Was it just the two women in the lab?\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	1					14	Most of the time, oui.\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	2					14	Hmm...\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	3					14	And one of them, you only heard her voice, right?\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	4					14	Yes, that is correct. Such a wonderful voice. It\nsent chills up my spine.\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	5					14	What was the other woman like?\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	6					14	Don't even think about it. She's not the slightest\ninterest in men.\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	7					14	No, it's part of my mission to...\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	8					14	Only teasing. Let me think...\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	9					14	I believe she was in her 30s.\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	10					14	Pretty, with a good sense of style, but austere in\nher tastes.\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	11					14	A very... Unusual woman.\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	12					14	And she was doing research on AI?\n
1	en	230	0xe6d10	59089	13					14	AI? So that is what she was up to.\n
