1	en	238	0xee440	60996	1				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Descartes, Bataille, Sartre, Baudrillard...\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	2				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	I'm familiar with Sartre myself.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	3				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	He called Che Guevara the most complete man of\nthe century, didn't he?\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	4				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Smart guy.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	5				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	He does tend to sympathize with the left. What\nelse do you know about him.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	6				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	...That's it.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	7				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	You know nothing else?\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	8				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	...Nope.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	9				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Ooh la la. The man is one of the giants of\nexistentialism, you know.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	10				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Exitentialism? I've been meaning to look into that.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	11				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Nothing more dangerous than sneaking in without\nfirst securing an exit...\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	12				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	No, existentialism. Sometimes I wonder if my\nEnglish is not better than yours.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	13				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Sorry, I'm just... not into philosophy.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	14				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Is that so? I would imagine it might really enrich\nyour life.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	15				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	I'd rather take action now than spend time thinking\nabout\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	16				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	what we are or how we're supposed to live.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	17				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	I guess you could say I live my philosophy.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	18				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Interesting. That sounds like something Sartre\nwould say.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	19				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Yeah?\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	20				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	He says we're born with no defined nature,\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	21				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	and that we're free to make our "self" what we wish.\n
1	en	238	0xee440	60996	22				v_bri_ccl0170_000_0	32	Free? So he was one of those devil-may-care kind\nof guys, huh?\n
