1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	2	2201	3873	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	I was 17 at the time. I'd skipped a few grades and\nwas a sophomore at MIT.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	3	4026	5126	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	I remember feeling kind of apathetic about the\nnews that came in every day.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	4	5182	6617	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	It seemed clear to me that as long as they had a\ngrasp of the concept of nuclear deterrence,\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	5	6617	7119	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	there was nothing to fear.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	6	7272	8400	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	Either that, or they were fanning that fear on\npurpose.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	7	8400	9947	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	As a way to secure a bigger defense budget...?\nHeh, I can see that.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	8	9961	10727	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	But if that was their plan, it kind of backfired.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	9	10741	11856	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	Because it ushered in the era of Détente between\nEast and West.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	10	11856	12678	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	Coldman's really going to do it this time.\n
1	en	242	0xf26a0	62058	11	12747	13346	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0020_000_0	15	Once the nuclear genie is out of the bottle,\n
