1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	0				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	But you know... there's something I've never been\nable to figure out.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	1				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	Is the Cold War really a war, or is it really peace...?\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	2				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	Doc, what are you...?\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	3				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	People called it a "cold war," but I disagreed.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	4				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	Sure, nuclear stockpiles are increasing, threats are\nmultiplying,\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	5				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	the U.S. and the Soviet Union have enough power\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	6				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	to destroy the human race a hundred times over.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	7				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	But nobody's actually being killed. Small-scale\nconflicts and proxy wars, maybe...\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	8				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	But nuclear deterrence has averted another world\nwar.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	9				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	The world's far more peaceful today than it was\nbefore.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	10				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	And the breakthroughs we've made in space\nexploration\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	11				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	thanks to Cold War competition - fantastic, don't\nyou think?\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	12				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	No... We didn't need to rush into space like that...\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	13				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	Going into space may have been mankind's dream,\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	14				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	but good people were sacrificed in the scramble.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	15				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	...Maybe so. NASA's definitely got some skeletons in\nits closet...\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	16				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	Same goes for the nuclear arms race.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	17				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	Atomic testing has killed civilians and exposed\nthousands to radiation.\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	18				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	Believe me, I know...\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	19				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	And now this... What peace was I trying to protect,\nanyway?\n
1	en	243	0xf34f0	62287	20				v_bri_huy0040_000_0	21	The more I think about it, the less I understand.\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	0					16	Let's speak in hypotheticals for a minute.\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	1					16	Say you wanted to make a clone of yourself...\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	2					16	A clone? Para-Medic had the same idea. It's\nscience fiction.\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	3					16	I'm just hypothesizing here. OK, not a clone, then.\nYou have any kids?\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	4					16	Nope.\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	5					16	Wife?\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	6					16	...Never been tied down.\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	7					16	OK, then... so we're still talking hypotheticals.\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	8					16	Say you had a son who'd inherited your genes,\n
1	en	243	0xf3c40	62404	9					16	someone with the same combat abilities as you.\n
