1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	0	445	1421	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Nuclear deterrence means preventing the use of\nnuclear weapons\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	1	1421	2661	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	in conflicts between states. But what about other\nsituations?\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	2	2661	2953	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Like what?\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	3	2953	3761	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Terrorism has been on the rise in recent years,\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	4	3761	4736	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	from separatist movements to far-left extremists.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	5	4736	6018	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	What would happen if nuclear weapons fell into\nterrorist hands?\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	6	6018	7091	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Without a state - that is, without territory of their\nown\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	7	7091	8080	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	- the chances of having nukes used against them\nare slim.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	8	8122	8958	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	They have no reason to fear a nuclear strike.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	9	9000	10476	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Conversely, they have no reason to hesitate to use\nnukes against their adversaries.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	10	10476	11633	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	You've got a point. All the ICBMs and strategic\nbombers in the world\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	11	11633	12260	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	amount to nothing against a terrorist group.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	12	12260	13318	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Right! Of course, this is all still hypothetical.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	13	13360	13959	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Countries keep their nukes under tight watch\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	14	13959	15032	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	- there's no immediate danger of terrorists getting\ntheir hands on them.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	15	15032	16021	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	But the day may come when the proposition of\nnuclear terrorism\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	16	16021	16885	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	makes nuclear deterrence theory a dead letter.\n
1	en	244	0xf4740	62580	17	16885	18125	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0050_010_0	18	Nuclear terrorism... Interesting.\n
1	en	244	0xf4d90	62681	0					5	What are we going to do, Snake? If Peace Walker\nattacks Mother Base...\n
