1	en	252	0xfc530	64595	0	445	1574	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0160_000_0	10	Peace Walker contains an assembly of two AI pods.\n
1	en	252	0xfc530	64595	1	1588	2674	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0160_000_0	10	One of them is the Mammal Pod, which Dr.\nStrangelove developed.\n
1	en	252	0xfc530	64595	2	2688	3469	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0160_000_0	10	The other's the Reptile Pod, which is mine.\n
1	en	252	0xfc530	64595	3	3469	3845	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0160_000_0	10	What's the difference?\n
1	en	252	0xfc530	64595	4	3845	4848	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0160_000_0	10	The Reptile Pod is the attitude control AI.\n
