1	en	255	0xff000	65280	18				v_bri_huy0230_010_0	25	But now I see I was wrong!\n
1	en	255	0xff000	65280	19				v_bri_huy0230_010_0	25	...Look, I'm sorry. But I just don't get what you see\nin her.\n
1	en	255	0xff000	65280	20				v_bri_huy0230_010_0	25	Well, I wouldn't expect a barbarian who opens\n
1	en	255	0xff000	65280	21				v_bri_huy0230_010_0	25	other people's private correspondence to\nunderstand.\n
1	en	255	0xff000	65280	22				v_bri_huy0230_010_0	25	Fine, then. Deliver it yourself.\n
1	en	255	0xff000	65280	23				v_bri_huy0230_010_0	25	Huh?! N-no, I... No way, I could never...\n
1	en	255	0xff000	65280	24				v_bri_huy0230_010_0	25	You've got a long way to go, Huey...\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	0	445	1476	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	You ever see the movie "2001: A Space Odyssey"?\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	1	1476	1852	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	Can't say I have.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	2	1852	3301	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	Fantastic flick... The outer space special effects\nare incredible enough,\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	3	3301	4263	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	but the depiction of AI is what really stands out.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	4	4263	4583	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	There's an AI ?\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	5	4583	6339	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	Yeah. A spacecraft pilot AI called HAL. It plays a\nmajor role in the story.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	6	6339	6965	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	Dr. Strangelove loves it, too.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	7	6965	7913	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	Did I ever tell you about the time we first met up\nin Costa Rica?\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	8	7913	8164	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	No.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	9	8164	8860	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	You know how she hates men, right?\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	10	8874	10114	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	So we hadn't seen each other since NASA, and we\njust weren't hitting it off...\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	11	10142	11674	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	until we started talking about HAL, and then she\nstarted going off.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	12	11758	12608	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	The way she talked about it was so intellectual.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	13	12650	14266	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	The way she analyzed every plot detail, how\npassionate she was about the AI...\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	14	14308	15018	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	It made me fall for her all over again.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	15	15018	15380	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	Uh huh.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	16	15380	16746	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	You know what? Here's to HAL, for bringing her\nand me closer together!\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	17	16760	18459	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	You should ask her about "2001," too. Then you'll\nunderstand just how amazing she is.\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	18	18459	18836	0x0e28dce6	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	Amazing, huh...\n
1	en	255	0xff720	65394	19	18836	19880	0x0ea8e31c	v_bri_huy0190_000_0	20	HAL... Now there's a good name...\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	0					8	The Pupa increases its mobility by using\ncompressed air to hover its rear section.\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	1					8	It moves by means of its treads and boosters.\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	2					8	Those boosters also provide the propulsion needed\nfor high-speed movement.\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	3					8	So if I take out the boosters, it won't be able to\ncharge?\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	4					8	Right.\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	5					8	I suppose you could also avoid its attacks by lying\ndown beneath it...\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	6					8	The Pupa is also equipped with electrical shock\nunits.\n
1	en	255	0xffda0	65498	7					8	It uses these devices - they look like lightning rods\n- to direct discharge.\n
