1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	0				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Futbol, or "soccer" as it is known in the states,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	1				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	is extremely popular here.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	2				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	It has not caught on yet in the US,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	3				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	but it has legions of rabid fans all across Latin\nAmerica.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	4				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	These fans can get so rowdy\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	5				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	that it is commonly believed El Salvador and\nHonduras went to war in 1969 over scuffles in a\nsoccer match.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	6				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	In reality, tensions between the two countries were\nalready high.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	7				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	The match was merely one of the sparks that set\nthem off.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	8				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	But these people are so passionate about the\nsport\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	9				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	that the story seems plausible.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	10				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Predictably, many of the soldiers here are fans.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	11				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	They have apparently divided themselves\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	12				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	into Costa Rican and Nicaraguan teams and\nstarted playing each other.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	13				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	To play, you need a ball and two goals.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	14				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	The R&D team built and set up simple goals on the\ndeck.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	15				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	I had absolutely no interest,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	16				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	but Chico insisted that I come and watch.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	17				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	It was not a proper match by any means -\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	18				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	the pitch was not even regulation size -\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	19				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	but the players and spectators alike got pretty\nexcited.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	20				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	They banged empty cans and shouted cheers\nthrough the handmade megaphones.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	21				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	It almost felt like Carnival.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	22				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Huey, the referee, blew a whistle to start the\nmatch.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	23				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	The soldiers' training has left them in excellent\nphysical shape.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	24				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	But they lacked the honed skills of professionals,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	25				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	and their play was quite rough.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	26				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Midway through, one of the men collided with\nanother.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	27				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	They started shouting at one another, but Huey\nstepped in.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	28				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	"I thought we had forsaken our countries, become\none with the earth," he said,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	29				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	quoting Snake.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	30				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	"We're not competing for national pride here.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	31				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	And we are not fighting for the good of any one\ncountry."\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	32				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	"This is not a war. Soccer's a peaceful sport, am I\nright?"\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	33				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	The soldiers nodded.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	34				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	They know the pain of war, and they share Snake's\nvision.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	35				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Perhaps that is why this all resonates with them.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	36				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Team Costa Rica was down a man,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	37				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	and somehow I was picked to fill in.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	38				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Costa Rica had the advantage up until that point -\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	39				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	I suppose Huey wanted to keep it balanced.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	40				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	The soldiers agreed with Huey's call.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	41				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Maybe the Costa Rican players felt an even match\nup would be more fun, too.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	42				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	I could not be bothered to run at first,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	43				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	but chasing the ball out there in the hot sun, I was\nsoon drenched in sweat.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	44				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Before long I found myself actively seeking out the\nball,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	45				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	partially out of desperation.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	46				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	I picked up a loose ball deep on the opponents'\nside of the field.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	47				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Even though he's Nicaraguan, Chico cheered me\non, yelling "Go for it! Shoot!"\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	48				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	I launched that ball as hard as I could,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	49				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	only to have it blocked by the keeper.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	50				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Disappointment only increased my determination.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	51				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	In the end, I didn't score a single goal,\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	52				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	and Costa Rica gave up its lead.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	53				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	It was really close, though.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	54				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	We congratulated each other on a good match\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	55				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	and sprawled out in the shade on the deck,\nexhausted.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	56				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	The ocean breeze felt so nice on my sun-soaked\nbody.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	57				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	Nuke came over - it is one of his favorite spots -\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	58				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	and stretched out next to me.\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	59				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	And together\n
1	en	269	0x10d1e0	68894	60				v_paz_dry_0040_000_0	61	we watched fluffy white clouds drift lazily across\nthe clear blue sky.\n
