1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	0					27	Protecting one's health is an important part of any\nagent's job,\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	1					27	but despite my best efforts, I have caught a cold.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	2					27	Now that I think about it,\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	3					27	Mother Base's numbers are on the rise,\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	4					27	with soldiers coming from all different places and\nbackgrounds.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	5					27	It is no wonder, then, that sooner or later someone\nwould bring in a virus.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	6					27	That said, what I have got is just a common cold.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	7					27	The medical team said I'd need a few days' rest,\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	8					27	so I've been restricted to my room and put on bed\nrest.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	9					27	I thought I'd gotten used to not having anyone\naround to relate to...\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	10					27	But at times like these, being alone is just...\nmiserable.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	11					27	All I could do is lay there and stroke Nuke's back,\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	12					27	trying to take my mind off how bad I felt.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	13					27	Nuke just sat there, not making a sound.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	14					27	But I did have visitors:\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	15					27	Amanda and Chico, Huey, Cecile, Miller, and a few\nof the soldiers I've become relatively close to.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	16					27	Amanda made me a soup with herbs she said were\ngood for a cold.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	17					27	Miller told me to take it easy. "I will sing you a\nlullaby,"\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	18					27	he said, then broke out a guitar and sang some\nincomprehensible song in Japanese.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	19					27	I did not need to understand the lyrics to know\nhe's an awful singer.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	20					27	Then he said, "You know what is good for a cold?\nSuppositories! Here, I'll show you..."\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	21					27	He began to take off his pants, so I threw my\ntissue box at him to make him go away.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	22					27	Then Strangelove showed up, saying she had some\nmiracle Indian cure.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	23					27	"It has got eucalyptus extract," she said. "It works\nbest if you rub it into your chest."\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	24					27	And then she tried to take off my nightshirt.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	25					27	I whacked her with my pillow. And that got rid of\nher.\n
1	en	271	0x10f840	69508	26					27	Chico brought me a little flower in a cup.\n
