1	en	273	0x111960	70038	0					20	D'you know Miller, Snake's right hand man?\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	1					20	Apparently he's got at least one serious weakness.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	2					20	He is an insatiable womanizer.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	3					20	He does not bother me, most likely because he\nconsiders teenagers off limits.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	4					20	But he has hit on every single one of the few\nfemale solders here at Mother Base.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	5					20	They ought to be telling him where to stick it, but\nend up falling for it so easily.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	6					20	I think some of it stems from the fact that he is\nactually not that bad looking.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	7					20	Anyway, today that nasty habit got him in trouble.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	8					20	He and Snake got into one of their rare fights, and\nI was there to see it.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	9					20	They burst out of the showers, completely naked,\ntrading punches.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	10					20	I am no child - the sight of a naked man doesn't\nmake me blush. But this was something else.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	11					20	"Maybe this'll teach you!" Snake yelled as he\nslammed his fists into Miller's chest.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	12					20	I heard later that apparently he'd been two-timing\nsomeone...\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	13					20	and that same someone had gone to Snake with\nher troubles.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	14					20	As I see it, it is her own fault for letting herself be\ndeceived like that.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	15					20	If she's too dumb to see though Miller's lies, then\nshe got what she deserved.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	16					20	But this was not the first time it had happened, or\nthe second, and Snake read Miller the riot act.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	17					20	Miller argued back, and what began as a shouting\nmatch turned into a fistfight.\n
1	en	273	0x111960	70038	18					20	"You son of a bitch!" Miller yelled as he swung.\n
