1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	1					15	Since Snake and his soldiers spend so much time\nfighting,\n
1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	2					15	they're setting aside one day a year for peace and\nrelaxation.\n
1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	3					15	I do not know all the details, but apparently that is\nwhat Snake and Miller decided.\n
1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	4					15	The soldiers love the idea, of course.\n
1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	5					15	There is so little fun to be had here that\neverybody looks forward to events like these.\n
