1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	7					15	"C'mon, we even both have 'peace' in our names,"\nsaid Miller.\n
1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	8					15	"And Zadornov - that old Russkie's name has\nsomething to do with peace, too, right?\n
1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	9					15	"Hey, as long as we're having a day of peace, we\nought to get an act together - The Three Peace\nBand!"\n
1	en	274	0x112b00	70320	10					15	I thought he was joking.\n
