1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	5					44	Miller's already finished writing the song. It's called\n"Love Deterrent (KOI NO YOKUSHI-RYOKU)"\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	6					44	- it is about a girl who can't express her true\nfeelings.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	7					44	I have been practicing.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	8					44	I am no pro, but I was pretty sure I would do a\ndecent job.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	9					44	And now this...\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	10					44	Cipher found out that ZEKE was complete.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	11					44	He must have someone inside Mother Base besides\nme.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	12					44	Spinning his tightly wound web of control, leaving\nno room for individual will - typical.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	13					44	When they found out ZEKE was complete, I was\nordered to execute the operation immediately.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	14					44	If I was going to enjoy just one day of peace, I had\nto ensure the plan could not move forward.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	15					44	...I tried to sabotage ZEKE.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	16					44	I thought by damaging the drive system, they\nwould have no choice but to delay their plans...\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	17					44	I waited until midnight and then snuck into the\nhangar.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	18					44	There would be trouble if it looked like sabotage.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	19					44	I selected one of the drive system's load-bearing\nparts and carefully worked to warp its shape.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	20					44	The legs' drive system requires a high degree of\nprecision to operate.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	21					44	Even the smallest deviation would have done it.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	22					44	Then Chico walked in.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	23					44	Maybe it was one of those nights where he could\nnot sleep.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	24					44	In any case, he saw me, panicked, and took off\nrunning.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	25					44	It would have been easy to kill him. But I could not!\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	26					44	I know he... likes me.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	27					44	It is not as if I would ever have an interest in a\nchild like him...\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	28					44	But I could not pull the trigger. Not at him. Not in\nthe back.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	29					44	Will he tell them?\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	30					44	Or is there a chance he will keep it secret?\nProtect me...\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	31					44	...No.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	32					44	He knows now... Knows I am not who he thought I\nwas...\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	33					44	He ran without even questioning what I was doing.\nThere is no chance he does not know.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	34					44	And soon, all I have built here will end.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	35					44	And if Cipher has another agent among them...\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	36					44	If he finds out I tried to sabotage ZEKE...\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	37					44	This place will no longer be my "heaven."\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	38					44	...Then it is settled.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	39					44	I make my move now.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	40					44	Chico walked in before my sabotage was complete,\nso ZEKE should still be operational.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	41					44	It might not run at full speed or power, but I do\nnot have time to fix that.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	42					44	Without ZEKE, I do not have a chance in hell of\nwinning.\n
1	en	275	0x1135b0	70491	43					44	I must act fast before Chico sounds the alarm...\n
