1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	0					12	And who should she find awaiting her return to\nRussia?\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	1					12	The one who'd turned her sleeper against her,\nwho'd fed them lies all this time?\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	2					12	It was her former comrade-in-arms, the father of\nher child.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	3					12	The man known as The Sorrow.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	4					12	He didn't know it was The Boss who'd sent the\nsleeper.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	5					12	Or to be more precise, the Soviet Philosophers\nnever told him.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	6					12	Former lovers, forced to fight to the death.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	7					12	"One would live, and one would die," she told me.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	8					12	"That was the revenge the Soviet Philosophers had\nin store for me."\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	9					12	If both of them survived, their child would suffer in\ntheir place.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	10					12	They were left with no other option.\n
1	en	285	0x11dc60	73158	11					12	The Boss shot him.\n
