2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	0					17	Snake, the doctor's safe here with us.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	1					17	Huey, how're you feeling?\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	2					17	Never better. This is quite the pad you've\ngot here, Boss. I'm impressed.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	3					17	Call me Snake.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	4					17	Whatever you say. Like it or not,\neveryone here calls you Boss.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	5					17	By the way, if you're at all interested in\nimproving your tech,\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	6					17	by all means assign me to the R&D section.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	7					17	I'm pretty sure I'll be of some use.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	8					17	Once we have the necessary materials\nand blueprints, we can start work on that\nbipedal mech.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	9					17	I appreciate that, but are you sure you're\nOK with having your work used for war?\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	10					17	I'm... I'll be using it to keep past mistakes\nin check.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	11					17	If I can help thwart the Peace Walker\nproject, I'm happy to do it.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	12					17	Deterrence theory, Huey-style, huh?\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	13					17	Heh. Anyway, if you need any intel on the\nenemy's weapons or electronic brains,\ncontact me.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	14					17	I've been given my own frequency.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	15					17	Sounds good to me, Doc. I'll do that.\n
2	en	906	0x38a660	232038	16					17	Good. Whatever the means, you must put\na stop to their plans!\n
