2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	0					31	Snake...\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	1					31	Yeah...\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	2					31	It's good to hear your voice again.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	3					31	Sorry! Hey, you OK?\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	4					31	Yeah.... Lungs taste like charcoal.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	5					31	No smoking for you for a while, huh?\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	6					31	Nah, I'll be fine. I'd better get moving.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	7					31	Nice work.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	8					31	What's the situation with you? Everyone\nOK?\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	9					31	Yeah... But there's a slight problem. I can't\nget a hold of Paz.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	10					31	Paz? I thought the "professor" was\nlooking after her?\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	11					31	So did I. Here's the deal.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	12					31	I started thinking, and I sent someone\nover to the "school" the "professor"\nmentioned.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	13					31	...And the "school" doesn't exist?\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	14					31	No, it exists, but Paz has been a no-show.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	15					31	The person at the school said neither the\n"professor"\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	16					31	nor Paz had been seen there in quite\nsome time.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	17					31	...Coldman knew about us. We've been\nmarked by the CIA.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	18					31	The KGB and Paz brought us into all this.\nColdman must know about them, too.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	19					31	You think... Coldman's got them...?\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	20					31	No. Remember, Gálvez isn't some\npencil-pusher.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	21					31	Yeah... The KGB'll have eyes on Coldman\nnight and day, too.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	22					31	Which could mean they knew what the\nCIA would try to do and are just staying\nout of sight...\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	23					31	Let's hope so. See what you can get out\nof the KGB, Kaz.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	24					31	All right. Back to work.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	25					31	I'd better get moving.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	26					31	Snake, we haven't detected any signs\nthat Peace Walker's been activated,\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	27					31	at least from above ground.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	28					31	It's still in the hangar you were in earlier.\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	29					31	This time, it's really our last chance.\nDestroy that AI!\n
2	en	910	0x38e660	233062	30					31	On my way.\n
