2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	18					45	You can thank Amanda.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	19					45	Snake, that river you chased the basilisco\nacross is the Rio San Juan.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	20					45	The other side is our country.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	21					45	I had some Nicaraguan compas track it\nthere.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	22					45	They're focos from the GPP (Guerra\nPopular Prolongada) faction,\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	23					45	so we don't work together so much...\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	24					45	Where'd it go?\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	25					45	West, along the border, towards Lago\nCocibolca.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	26					45	There's a U.S. military supply base on the\nsoutheastern shore of the lake.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	27					45	Ever since that earthquake two years\nago, America's had the entire region to\nitself.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	28					45	That is where the basilisco is. I'm sure of\nit.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	29					45	Lago Cocibolca... How do I get across the\nborder?\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	30					45	There's a route that we use to cross.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	31					45	It's just a little boat, but I can introduce\nyou to the captain.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	32					45	I appreciate it.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	33					45	We will never leave Nicaragua at the\nmercy of someone like William Walker\nagain.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	34					45	Snake, Coldman's going to launch the\nnuke from that base. He's targeting MSF.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	35					45	Based on what Huey's told us, it'll take\ntwo more days to prep for launch.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	36					45	...But it looks like there's another reason\nthey picked that date.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	37					45	What's that?\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	38					45	Tomorrow is day one of a U.S.-Soviet\nsummit in Vladivostok.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	39					45	The launch is probably connected\nsomehow.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	40					45	That's right... They're holding the SALT-II\n(Strategic Arms Limitation Treaty) talks.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	41					45	You think Coldman's trying to disrupt the\nnegotiations?\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	42					45	Either that, or use it as a bargaining chip...\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	43					45	He's still got Paz, too. At any rate, we're\nrunning out of time.\n
2	en	911	0x38f200	233248	44					45	I'll figure something out.\n
