2	en	914	0x392460	234054	3				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	What happened?\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	4				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	She wants to leave sickbay and get back\non the battlefield, but she's not fully\nhealed.\n
