2	en	914	0x392460	234054	6				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	You have to talk some sense into her.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	7				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	Is she with you right now?\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	8				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	No, she's in sickbay.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	9				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	She keeps shouting about how she\ndoesn't want to be there.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	10				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	She won't shut up about it. She's driving\nme-\n
