2	en	914	0x392460	234054	14				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	I'm really not in the mood for jokes, Snake.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	15				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	I'm serious. Let her go.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	16				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	Why? So she can come back in a body\nbag?\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	17				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	I'm really not in the mood for jokes, Kaz.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	18				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	What are you talking about?\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	19				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	Amanda isn't the type to just sit around\nin sickbay.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	20				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	She has a sense of duty - her purpose in\nlife is to fight.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	21				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	The battlefield isn't just the best thing\nfor her, it's the best thing for her\ncompas, too.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	22				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	She'll be a huge morale boost - that can\nonly benefit MSF.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	23				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	You think so?\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	24				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	You're good at fighting, Kaz - one of the\nbest...\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	25				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	but you've got a lot to learn when it\ncomes to people.\n
2	en	914	0x392460	234054	26				v_myo_rad_0010_000_0	30	... So where should I put her?\n
