2	en	915	0x393270	234279	0				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	Got a sec, Snake?\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	1				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	What's up?\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	2				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	It's about Paz. You know, she doesn't\nhave any family.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	3				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	She got a scholarship thanks to\nZadornov, and was living at the dorms...\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	4				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	But he was KGB.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	5				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	All signs are her scholarship came from\nthe KGB, too.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	6				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	Even if they let him go, she's not going to\nbe seeing any more money.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	7				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	It wouldn't have been much anyway.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	8				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	So I was wondering, what about letting\nher stay here a while?\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	9				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	What does she think?\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	10				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	She says she wants to help out.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	11				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	It would only be temporary. She's still in\nshock.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	12				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	Right now, no one understands her better\nthan we do.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	13				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	OK. But Kaz,\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	14				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	don't take your eyes off her.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	15				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	What do you mean?\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	16				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	It won't be easy getting used to this kind\nof life.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	17				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	I know, Snake. I'm not trying to turn her\ninto one of us.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	18				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	You should talk to her yourself later.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	19				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	OK.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	20				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	And, ah,\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	21				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	Dr. Strangelove wants to come, too.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	22				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	Strangelove?\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	23				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	Well she's out of a job now, and she'd\nhave a problem returning to England.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	24				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	You can talk to her about it.\n
2	en	915	0x393270	234279	25				v_myo_rad_0040_000_0	26	Anyway, you don't need me to tell you\nhow good she'd be for R&D.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	0					29	Thanks for putting me on the R&D team,\nSnake.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	1					29	I'll cut to the chase.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	2					29	We've commenced development on our\nown bipedal weapon.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	3					29	The only thing is we don't exactly have\neasy access to resources here.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	4					29	Yeah, unfortunately we don't have the\nbudget of a defense department behind\nus.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	5					29	I understand. That's why I want to ask\nyou something.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	6					29	If you fight any more AI weapons,\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	7					29	could you try to gather as many of their\nparts as you can?\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	8					29	That would really make things go a lot\nsmoother.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	9					29	Again, easier said than done.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	10					29	If anyone can do it, you can, Boss.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	11					29	You single-handedly took out the Pupa.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	12					29	True.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	13					29	Look, if you're not interested, I can just\nwork with what we have here.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	14					29	I'm not trying to force you to take\nunnecessary risks. You're the boss\naround here.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	15					29	All right. No promises, but I'll think about\nit.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	16					29	Great.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	17					29	Also, each AI weapon has a "head part"\nthat serves as the core of its armament.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	18					29	Recovering a head part will allow you to\nuse the weapon associated with that part.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	19					29	...But those guys won't go down without a\nfight.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	20					29	So don't get too preoccupied with this\nstuff.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	21					29	Don't worry. I'm not about to risk my life\nfor a bunch of scrap.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	22					29	I would hope not.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	23					29	One more thing: our new bipedal weapon\nneeds a name.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	24					29	Good point.\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	25					29	We can't keep calling it "our bipedal\nweapon."\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	26					29	I had a talk with Miller, and we came up\nwith "Metal Gear ZEKE."\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	27					29	Metal Gear... ZEKE...?\n
2	en	915	0x3939d0	234397	28					29	Yep.\n
