2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	0				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	Snake, we fitted ZEKE with its own AI Pod.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	1				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	We were having trouble adjusting the AI,\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	2				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	but Dr. Strangelove was able to get it up\nand running.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	3				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	Strangelove?\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	4				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	Why the surprise, Snake?\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	5				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	Well... We're an army without borders.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	6				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	We need a deterrent against foreign\nintervention - that's what ZEKE is for.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	7				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	It may even prove necessary to...\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	8				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	I'm not against deterrence itself.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	9				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	The problem is when a nation comes to\nrely on it.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	10				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	All that does is force a burden on its\npeople...\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	11				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	the same people that constitute the\nnation itself.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	12				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	The existence of nations is detrimental to\nman.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	13				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	That's why I, one without a nation, see\npotential in MSF.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	14				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	But power is required for you to distance\nyourself from nations.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	15				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	I will do whatever I can to assist with that.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	16				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	...Glad to hear it.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	17				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	And... I merely lent Huey a helping hand.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	18				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	I will not give ZEKE an AI like hers.\n
2	en	916	0x3945b0	234587	19				v_myo_rad_0070_000_0	20	I wouldn't expect you to.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	0				v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	Snake, I'm proud to announce that\npreparations for Metal Gear ZEKE are\ncomplete.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	1	1462	2048	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	We can activate it any time.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	2	2048	2702	0x0e28dce6	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	Got it. Thanks, Huey.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	3	2758	3176	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	No need to thank me.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	4	3218	4068	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	At least now I can finally say I helped you\nwith something.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	5	4151	4806	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	You can use it in Outer Ops, too.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	6	4876	5712	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	Just select ZEKE when you're forming\nyour unit.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	7	5795	6492	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	Be sure to take it out for a field test.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	8	6534	6757	0x0e28dce6	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	OK.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	9	6798	7815	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	You can change weapons and check\nmemory boards just like before.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	10	7927	9013	0x0ea8e31c	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	Use your observations from a field test\nto make any adjustments.\n
2	en	916	0x394bd0	234685	11	9027	9571	0x0e28dce6	v_myo_rad_0080_000_0	12	A work in progress, huh?\n
2	en	917	0x3958b0	234891	0				v_myo_rad_0100_000_0	9	Who would have thought that little girl\nwas working against us...\n
2	en	917	0x3958b0	234891	1				v_myo_rad_0100_000_0	9	Tell me about it. She had everybody\nfooled. Me included.\n
2	en	917	0x3958b0	234891	2				v_myo_rad_0100_000_0	9	I can't believe I didn't pick up on anything.\n
2	en	917	0x3958b0	234891	3				v_myo_rad_0100_000_0	9	Snake, there's no point beating yourself\nup over the past.\n
